OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 JUN
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto is back with more exciting
OL,12,     Gnew releases and jazz classics,
OL,13,     Gand Huw Marc Bennett has a fourth
OL,14,     Gartist to celebrate on Flowers.
OL,15,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,16,     GFrench violinist Theotime
OL,17,     GLanglois de Swarte makes a much-
OL,18,     Ganticipated Proms debut as
OL,19,     Gsoloist with his ensemble Le
OL,20,     GConsort in a programme built
OL,21,     Garound violin concertos by
